      <blockquote>
        <p class="letter-lead">“The most useful things I learned didn’t come from a classroom. They came from people who had done the work and were willing to show how.”</p>
        <p>Hiveworx is built around that idea. Our mentors are makers, designers, builders and entrepreneurs. They teach the way they worked: they show the work, share the doubt and explain the decision.</p>
        <p>You don’t need a diploma or a portfolio to join. Bring curiosity and a sense that design matters. The goal is not to graduate. The goal is to learn something new, get interested enough to continue, and carry something useful back into your life.</p>
